# PharmaBro mobile — public client config.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are INLINED into the web/native bundle and are public by
# design — use ONLY the anon key here, never the service key. The app talks to the
# backend as a signed-in user (JWT), and the §8 read RPCs are REVOKEd from anon and
# GRANTed to authenticated (migrations 0111/0112/0118), so the anon key alone can't
# read protected data — that's the intended security posture.
#
# For the e2e gate these are sourced from the gitignored supabase/functions/.env
# (SB_URL -> EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, ANON_KEY -> EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY).
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon-key>
